  "description": "SHIMANO EP6\n\nATOM+ SL ebikes feature the lighter, quieter and more compact Shimano EP6 motor, with the same low pedaling resistance as the EP801. Ideal for use on trails or in urban terrain, it guarantees natural pedaling and a maximum torque of 85Nm.\n\nTS SYSTEM\n\nBattery access at the top of the downtube provides excellent ergonomics.\n\n155KM OF AUTONOMY\n\nThe battery layout in the diagonal tube allows us to accommodate up to 720Wh with the smallest section of the market, offering a range of 155 Km. The battery can be charged directly from a port integrated in the frame or from the battery, allowing a fast charge with 80% of the capacity.\n\nSPLIT PIVOT\n\nThe ATOM+ SL, with the split pivot suspension system for riding on any terrain. Maintaining more than 100% of the antisquat -which guarantees pedaling efficiency- and brak e squat -which guarantees optimal braking.\n\nREMOTE SC-EN 500\n\nCompact and customizable, you can have different profiles and fit a wide variety of handlebars and wiring harnesses. Its compact, easy-to-read display incorporates dynamic images when changing assistance levels.",
